The original PDF doc here was generated from
an MS slide maker tool.

The Rakudoc and png files were created by a
piece of code produced with the help of
ChatGPT. See the process in the RakudocToPDF
project.

The goal now is to edit those files as
necessary to update them and turn them 
back to a decent looking slide deck in
PDF in the RakudocToPDF module
which is in-work at alias 'cdrd'.
